    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925000/extras/a36ec2be90c460973e6f55edea9fe7c6.poster.avif?t=1747196384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925000/extras/a36ec2be90c460973e6f55edea9fe7c6.webm?t=1747196384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925000/extras/a36ec2be90c460973e6f55edea9fe7c6.mp4?t=1747196384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Story</h2>When a strange and eerie figure swept by, when a cat demon descended upon me with a huge katana, when infected by a \u201cblood cicada\u201d... what would I do...would I scream...<br>No, I would thank them\u2026It was them that helped me make the acquaintance of my...spiritual support I had hoped to see within me? No, rather, she was my...spiritual god...?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925000/extras/06a74eeffd5f9f06cce8a5d2b02e71f9.avif?t=1747196384\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The cat demon of nine lives, Hitomi.</h2>[\u201cIt's hard to keep up with me.\u201d]<br>I was captivated by her. Even though she was a cat demon, yet...that emotion that came from within, it felt amazing. We spent a lot of time\u2026together...But I never had much courage to take a step forward...<br><br>[\u201cTake care of yourself until I get back, won\u2019t you, Yi.\u201d]<br>In a sudden attack, a samurai figure stabbed Hitomi... After that, I had a moment of courage\u2026and confessed my love to her\u2026<br>But she left, for some reason. She said, it was to make up for some fault she had made, an inevitable fault.<br>I waited for her for a long, long time...My demonisation was getting worse, and I was having a hard time distinguishing reality from illusion.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925000/extras/74dbd5e61cdc6b846f28a3496f56eee9.avif?t=1747196384\" /></div><br><br>[...Hitomi, I am going to wait for you to come back, not for you to \u201ccome back\u201d.]<br>Hitomi\u2026bad cat, wait for me, I must find you. I know you have been watching me, unti...<br>You left me.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925000/extras/0fe4db63a5e0f459ab05de193c2602e3.avif?t=1747196384\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Gameplay Instructions</h2>This is a normal galgame. You can navigate the plot to get hints for new plots, etc..<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Game Features</h2>\u25c7Two main female characters<br>\u25c7Game endings: 1 type",
